ts{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghostdragozn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-12T14:45:17Z","updated_at":"2026-04-13T06:27:53Z","body":"I encountered the same issue when upgrading from version 0.26.0 to 0.28.0. My system has 650 nodes; even when all nodes are offline, the “up” process increased from 20 ms (0.26.0) to 7 seconds (0.28.0). I’m looking into it and it seems the issue might be caused by UpdateNodeFromMapRequest()\n```\n UpdateNodeFromMapRequest() {\n      NodeStore.UpdateNode()      // ← Trigger batch\n      ↓\n      applyBatch() {\n          snapshotFromNodes(nodes, peersFunc)\n          ↓\n          peersFunc = polMan.BuildPeerMap()  // ← O(n²/2)!\n      }\n  }\n```","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/comments/4231727595/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"ghostdragozn","id":25016349,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MDE2MzQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25016349?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghostdragozn","html_url":"https://github.com/ghostdragozn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghostdragozn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghostdragozn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghostdragozn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghostdragozn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghostdragozn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghostdragozn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghostdragozn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghostdragozn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gh