oved small-tailnet `Up` latency without regressing larger-tailnet batch throughput?\n\nIf yes, I can keep the scope narrow: benchmark/test partial batch flush latency, preserve `node_store_batch_size`, update the tuning comment/docs, and avoid unrelated policy/cache rewrites.\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/comments/4703470985/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"maxpetrusenkoagent","id":280464918,"node_id":"U_kgDOELeOFg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/280464918?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxpetrusenkoagent","html_url":"https://github.com/maxpetrusenkoagent","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxpetrusenkoagent/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxpetrusenkoagent/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxpetrusenkoagent/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxpetrusenkoagent/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxpetrusenkoagent/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxpetrusenkoagent/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxpetrusenkoagent/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxpetrusenkoagent/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxpetrusenkoagent/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":26761582672,"node_id":"SE_lADOEFLz88753USazwAAAAY7HVhQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/events/26761582672","actor":{"login":"ElSamhaa","id":34912861,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0OTEyODYx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34912861?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ElSamhaa","htm